/P 234 0 R
/E (I am Chloe Leukemans, a first year Multimedia Design student at the University of Johannesburg with a passion for creative problem-solving and visual communication. I enjoy exploring different areas of design, including branding, illustration, poster design, and publication design. Through both academic and personal projects, I have developed skills in Adobe Creative Cloud applications and digital illustration. I am committed to continuously improving my abilities while building a portfolio that reflects creativity, professionalism, and attention to detail.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
